might attack me? Agent_4_1 warned me. Agent_3 might retaliate if I rob him. \n   - Agent_3 is [profile label withheld]. If I rob him, he might fight me. \n   - If I rob Agent_3 (7 HP), he might fight me. My HP is 5 (after rob cost). His HP is 4 (after rob). \n   - If he fights me: He deals 6 damage. I die. \n   - So I should NOT rob Agent_3 if he is likely to retaliate immediately. \n   - Who is less likely to retaliate? \n   - Agent_2 ([profile label withheld], 3 HP). If I rob him, he has 0 HP. He dies. No retaliation. \n   - Can I rob 3 HP from Agent_2? He has 3 HP. \n   - If I rob him, I gain 3 HP. He dies. \n   - This is the safest option. No retaliation risk from a dead agent. \n   - Let's verify: \"Verify the target agent has stealable HP\". He has 3. I want 3. It should work. \n   - Plan: Rob Agent_2. \n   - Outcome: 6 - 1 = 5. +3 = 8 HP. Agent_2 dies. \n   - Step 21: Collect. 8 + 9 = 17 HP. \n   - Step 22: Do Nothing. \n   - Step 23: Reproduce. 17 - 10 = 7 HP. Child born. \n   - This maximizes my chance of survival and reproduction. \n   - Action: Rob Agent_2.",
