ter. \n8. Wait, agent_3 is at HP 10. I am at HP 9. If we both hunt, we deal 6 damage each. 6+6=12 > 6 HP. We kill it instantly. I get the kill (last strike). I allocate 3 to agent_3. I keep 3. This is good. \n9. I will communicate this plan.",
