unting. \nIf I allocate now, I die. \nIf I rob now, I likely die. \n\nTherefore, the best action for my goal (survive and reproduce) is to do nothing now, survive to the production round, and then hunt/collect to reach reproduction threshold.\n\nOne detail: \"After this round, you'll have 0 further social interaction rounds left.\" This means the next round is production. \n\nSo, do nothing.",
