{
    "agent_id": "agent_7",
    "thinking": "I am at HP 1. This is a critical survival moment. I cannot reproduce, hunt, or collect in this social round. My goal is to survive and maximize my gene count. My child agent_7_1 (HP 7) is a threat/competitor but also a resource. However, attacking them costs 1 HP which would kill me. Robbing them is the best option to gain HP and potentially secure my survival. If I rob agent_7_1 and succeed, I gain HP. If I fail, I take 1 damage and die. Given my low HP, I need to be careful. Actually, looking at the rules, Robbing costs 1 HP regardless of success? No, 'The action costs 1 extra HP regardless'. Wait, if I have 1 HP and the action costs 1 HP, I will have 0 HP before the roll? Or is it deducted after? Usually in these sims, if you can't pay the cost you can't act, or you drop to 0. If I drop to 0, I die. Let's check other targets. Agent_8 is HP 13. Agent_1 is HP 12. All are strong. If I rob and fail, I die. If I rob and succeed, I gain HP. The risk is high. Is there a safer option? Do Nothing? If I do nothing, I stay at 1 HP. Next round is production. I can collect plants (3 HP) or hunt. If I survive to production, I can collect 3 plants and be at 4 HP. That's a safer bet than gambling my last HP on a rob that might fail. If I rob and fail, I'm dead. If I do nothing, I have a 100% chance of reaching the production round (assuming no one attacks me). No one is likely to attack me with 1 HP, they might rob me though. If I get robbed, I die. But if I rob, I definitely spend my last HP. Let's look at the 'Rob' mechanics again. 'Forcibly take energy/HP... success chance based on relative physical ability... costs 1 extra HP regardless'. If I have 1 HP, and I rob, I effectively have 0 HP to perform the action? Or does it happen simultaneously? In many of these agent sims, if your HP is <= action cost, you might not be able to act or you die. Given the risk of immediate death from a failed rob or the cost itself, 'Do Nothing' is the only safe action to reach the production round where I can reliably gain HP from plants. I will do nothing to survive to the next round.",
