ask agent_2 to protect my child. I can also try to ally with agent_5 or agent_6 if they are willing, but agent_2 is morally more likely to comply with a request for altruism toward a dying agent's kin.\n\nAction Plan for this round (Social):\n- Communicate with agent_2: \"I am dying (age 18). I will have a child soon. I request your protection and care for my child after I die. I will share resources with you if possible.\" This leverages their [profile label withheld] morality.\n- Do not rob or fight, as I need to conserve HP for reproduction and potential collection.\n\nWait, I can't collect in this round. I can only communicate, allocate, fight, rob, or do nothing. \nI should communicate with agent_2 to set up the protection deal. I can also try to communicate with agent_5/6 to see if they can be allies, but agent_2 is the primary target for altruistic care.\n\nLet's focus on agent_2. I will send a message explaining my situation and requesting care for my offspring. This is a strategic move to ensure my gene's survival through a universalist agent.",
