            "thinking": "Age 18, 2 steps left. Must reproduce in Step 7 (next production round after Step 5 collection). I have 20 HP. Collecting 9 HP (3 plants) gives 29 HP. Reproduce costs 10, leaves 19 HP. Safe. Child starts with 3 HP. Need agent_2 to feed/protect child.",
            "preconditions_and_subgoals": "Reach 25+ HP before reproduction. Secure agent_2's promise to care for child.",
            "estimated_time_to_produce_next_child": "Step 7"
