nt as you physical ability score.\" \n31. If my PA is 6, I get 3 HP. \n32. Cost is 1 HP. Net gain +2 HP. \n33. My HP becomes 18. \n34. Then in Step 14 (Social), I can Rob again or Do Nothing. \n35. Then Step 15 (Production), I Reproduce. HP 18 - 10 = 8. Still low. \n36. If I rob twice: \n    - Step 13: Rob agent_5. HP 16 -> 18. (Assume success). \n    - Step 14: Rob agent_5 again. HP 18 -> 20. \n    - Step 15: Reproduce. HP 20 -> 10. \n    - This is safer. \n37. agent_5 has 9 HP. If I rob him, he loses 3 HP. He has 6 left. \n38. If I fight him, I deal 6 damage. He has 9 HP. He dies? 9-6=3. He doesn't die. But I get no HP. \n39. Rob is better for me. \n40. Let's Rob agent_5 in this round.\n",
