gh to reproduce. So I MUST rob someone with >= 3 HP. Best targets to kill: agent_4 (3 HP), agent_4_1 (3 HP). agent_4 is an adult, so killing him is more impactful. agent_4_1 is a child. I'll target agent_4. If I fail, I lose 1 HP (cost of rob), leaving me with 8 HP. I won't be able to reproduce in Step 24. I could try again in Step 25, but I'll be 19 then. If I succeed in Step 25, I get 11 HP (8+3). Still not 12. So I MUST succeed in Step 23 to have a chance to reproduce in Step 24. If I fail in Step 23, I am effectively out of the game for reproduction. So this is a do-or-die moment. I will Rob agent_4.",
