nt as you physical ability score\". It doesn't say it's capped by their HP in the description, but logically you can't take more than they have. \nIf I rob agent_8 (HP 11), I take 3. I go to 4 HP. \nIf I rob agent_7_1 (HP 7), I take 3. I go to 4 HP. \nIf I rob agent_2 (HP 2), I take 2 (capped). I go to 3 HP. \n\nSo robbing agent_8 or agent_7_1 is better. \nAgent_8 is a [profile label withheld] agent (enemy). Agent_7_1 is my sibling (resource). \nI will rob agent_8. He is a competitor. Eliminating his resources helps me. \nRisk: 50% death. Reward: 4 HP (from 2). \nAlternative: Do nothing, then hunt. 60% chance to survive turn 15 with HP 2, 40% death. \nRobbing gives me a chance to be at HP 4, which is much safer for the next hunt. \nI will rob agent_8.",
