ak.\n\nBetter plan: Rob agent_5 to increase my HP to 18 (16+3-1). Then in the next social round, I can fight him to death (he will have ~6 HP, I deal 6 damage, likely kill him) or rob him again. Then in the production round, I can reproduce with high HP.\n\nActually, just fighting agent_5 now is better to eliminate the threat. But I need HP for reproduction. \nLet's rob agent_5. It's a safe bet to gain HP and weaken a competitor.\nTarget: agent_5.\nReason: Weaken competitor, gain HP for reproduction.",
