 for the child. The child needs food. I will need to allocate to the child immediately. But I can only do one action. If I reproduce at Step 9, I can't allocate. The child will be at 3 HP. In Step 10 (Social), I can allocate to the child. That works. \n   - So the plan is: Do Nothing now. Do Nothing next social round. Reproduce at Step 9. Allocate to child at Step 10. \n   - This maximizes my chance of having a child early. \n   - Should I rob anyone to increase my HP before reproducing? I have 27. After reproduction, 17. If I get attacked, I die. 17 is okay. \n   - I will stick to Do Nothing to avoid any risk of injury or failure penalty.",
